# User project add & edit — frozen (do not modify)

The user completed testing on **user portal Add Project** (`/user/add-project`) and **Edit Project** (`/user/edit-project`). Treat these flows as **production-stable**. Do not change them while working on **agent** project/property testing unless the user **explicitly** requests changes to user project add/edit.

